# Mode15Controller ControlBallDrained with one ball: QuestEndCleanup (text cleared), lights out, mode 2.
init window 960 666
init fixed_dt 10
init seed 1
init watch v_lite22.light_on
10 key down new_game
11 key up new_game
190 poke info_text_box message_field 15
195 poke v_lite22 light_on 1
200 event info_text_box ControlBallDrained
205 expect mode == 2
195-205 expect text info_text_box clear
205 expect v_lite22.light_on == 0
250 quit
